BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:56th Annual Fiddle and Food Festival
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
DTSTAMP:20261006T171832Z
UID:4239bb8ebeca78bbeea5d301@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:The Arizona State Fiddle Championship returns to Payson on Sat
 urday\, October 3\, as part of the B.U.C.K.L.E. Festival. For more than 50
  years\, this beloved competition has celebrated Arizona's rich western mu
 sic heritage by showcasing talented fiddlers from across the state. New th
 is year\, the championship concludes with the top two finalists facing off
  on the main festival stage during the evening's headliner concert. Compet
 ing fiddlers and their immediate families receive free admission to the fe
 stival weekend. Join us for an unforgettable day of music\, tradition\, an
 d western celebration in the heart of Arizona's Rim Country.\n\nEvent webs
 ite: https://discovergilacounty.com/festivals-fairs/\n\nVisit Arizona list
 ing: https://www.visitarizona.com/events/56th-annual-fiddle-and-food-festi
 val
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T171832Z
LOCATION:Mazatzal Hotel & Casino\, E Scout Lp\, Payson\, AZ\, USA
URL:https://www.visitarizona.com/events/56th-annual-fiddle-and-food-festiv
 al
END:VEVENT
