BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Study the Stars from Homolovi
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261010
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261011
DTSTAMP:20261006T171832Z
UID:5ad4bd4912a58815c37bffc4@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Monthly**s**tar parties through November. They feature a guest
  speaker in the visitor center followed by dark sky viewing through the Ho
 molovi Observatory’s Moore Telescope. Night sky targets change throughou
 t the year but may include deep space nebulae\, star clusters\, and more. 
 Homolovi is the only Arizona State Parks with its own observatory. Thank y
 ou to the Little Colorado River Valley Astronomy Club for supporting these
  astronomy events. Learn more about them at[www.lcrvac.org](http://www.lcr
 vac.org/) or[nightsky.jpl.nasa.gov/clubs/lcrvac](http://nightsky.jpl.nasa.
 gov/clubs/lcrvac/).\n\nEvent website: https://azstateparks.com/homolovi/ev
 ents/star-party-homolovi\n\nVisit Arizona listing: https://www.visitarizon
 a.com/events/study-the-stars-from-homolovi
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T171832Z
LOCATION:Homolovi State Park\, AZ-87\, Winslow\, AZ\, USA
URL:https://www.visitarizona.com/events/study-the-stars-from-homolovi
END:VEVENT
